  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After an extended period of time 3D audio breaks. What happens is multiple people will sound is if they are very close in front, back, or on the side of you even if they are across the room. Not only that but they may be in front of you but they sound like they are in your left or right ear even. Basically direction and distance for the 3D audio for people completely breaks down and is incorrect.\nSteps to reproduce: I've found no way to directly induce the bug. It occurs over time. Sometimes taking hours to occur and other times can occur in a shorter amount of time.\n1.) Stay in a lobby with people speaking for an extended period of time.\n\nI found this bug while working in unity on my avatar in the open beta for an extended period of time, as it took time to fix my avatar and discovered this bug. It only appears to affect pc as I haven't heard quest users mention getting this bug, but it has happened to 3 people on pc I was with.",
